## Bug

Qwen Chat tool-turn eviction saves a reasoning-free disk key even when the client replays `reasoning_content`. The returning, otherwise unchanged conversation cannot match the saved checkpoint.

**Reproduced on main `fc80bd6`:** Metal, M5 Max / 128 GiB, Qwen3.8 Q4, one resident slot, no MTP. Tools/instructions were unchanged; the saved file still existed at return:

