`remember_qwen_tool_turn_visible_checkpoint()` leaves `token_text_disk_key=false`. Its visible alias omits the latest reasoning; disk lookup requires an exact byte prefix.

Select token-text persistence when the **latest submitted assistant has nonblank reasoning**, unless execution selected a visible-history continuation. Keep the omission-compatible live alias and disk default. Tools or older reasoning alone are not evidence of echo.

